---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import OneBitLab from '../components/islands/OneBitLab';
import RisoPortraitLab from '../components/islands/RisoPortraitLab';
---

<Layout title="Lab" description="网页视觉实验：1-bit 抖动与 RISO 插画风格">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="font-ui text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Lab</h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
        视觉语言实验。从 1-bit 抖动到 RISO 错版插画，探索 Web 上的可交互图像。
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="riso-lab-title">
      <h2 id="riso-lab-title" class="font-ui text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">RISO 治愈小动物</h2>
      <RisoPortraitLab client:load />
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="riso-ui-title">
      <h2 id="riso-ui-title" class="font-ui text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">RISO UI 组件试验</h2>
      <div class="riso-ui-paper">
        <div class="riso-ui-grid">
          <article class="riso-ui-card">
            <div class="riso-ui-tags">
              <span>Riso Print</span>
              <span>Green Plate</span>
            </div>
            <h3>纸面与分色层</h3>
            <p>浅绿纸色作为基底，两层半透明绿色错位叠印，形成印刷品的手工温度。</p>
            <div class="riso-ui-actions">
              <button class="riso-ui-primary">Primary</button>
              <button>Secondary</button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-media">
            <div class="riso-ui-frame" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="riso-ui-caption">
              <strong>Halftone Frame</strong>
              <span>网点 + 错版边框</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <blockquote class="riso-ui-quote">
            <p>丝网版画的透明油墨重叠后，会生成第三种颜色；界面中的层也可以这样相遇。</p>
          </blockquote>

          <nav class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-nav-card" aria-label="RISO navigation demo">
            <h3>Navigation</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-nav">
              <a href="#riso-ui-title" aria-current="page">Home</a>
              <a href="#riso-ui-title">Archive</a>
              <a href="#riso-ui-title">Albums</a>
              <a href="#riso-ui-title">Lab</a>
            </div>
          </nav>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-form-card">
            <h3>Search &amp; Filters</h3>
            <label class="riso-ui-field">
              <span>Search</span>
              <input type="search" placeholder="Search articles, albums, links..." />
            </label>
            <div class="riso-ui-checks">
              <label><input type="checkbox" checked /><span>Illustration</span></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" /><span>Photography</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="riso-ui-demo" checked /><span>Green plate</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="riso-ui-demo" /><span>Blue plate</span></label>
            </div>
            <select aria-label="Sort demo">
              <option>Newest first</option>
              <option>Oldest first</option>
            </select>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-post-card">
            <div class="riso-ui-tags">
              <span>Article</span>
              <span>3 min</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Offset Printed Post</h3>
            <p>标题、摘要、日期与阅读时长使用清晰的编辑层级；纸面质感保留在卡片上。</p>
            <div class="riso-ui-meta">
              <time datetime="2026-08-18">Aug 18, 2026</time>
              <span>Reading demo</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-media">
            <div class="riso-ui-frame riso-ui-frame-blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="riso-ui-caption">
              <strong>Album Cell</strong>
              <span>Another plate</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card">
            <h3>States</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-states">
              <span class="riso-ui-success">Published</span>
              <span class="riso-ui-warning">Draft</span>
              <span class="riso-ui-danger">Sync failed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="riso-ui-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Demo progress" aria-valuenow="68">
              <span class="riso-ui-progress-value"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="riso-ui-hint">状态色保持 RISO 油墨的透明感，而不是使用实心屏幕色。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card">
            <h3>Pagination</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-pagination">
              <button aria-label="Previous page">←</button>
              <button class="active">1</button>
              <button>2</button>
              <button>3</button>
              <button aria-label="Next page">→</button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-list-card">
            <h3>Link List</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="#riso-ui-title">Paper Press</a><span>Friend</span></li>
              <li><a href="#riso-ui-title">Green Plate</a><span>RSS</span></li>
              <li><a href="#riso-ui-title">Halftone Club</a><span>Archive</span></li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card">
            <h3>Alert</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-alert">同步完成：3 篇文章、2 个相册已经进入纸面。</div>
            <div class="riso-ui-alert riso-ui-alert-error">同步失败：RSS 源暂时不可用。</div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-table-card">
            <h3>Data Table</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-table-wrap">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th>Source</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>Notion</td><td>Article</td><td><span class="riso-ui-success">Ready</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Telegram</td><td>Album</td><td><span class="riso-ui-warning">Partial</span></td></tr>
                  <tr><td>RSS</td><td>Link</td><td><span class="riso-ui-success">Ready</span></td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-type-card">
            <h3>Long-form Typography</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-longform">
              <p>长文阅读区需要主动降噪：保留纸色和轻微边缘，但取消正文上的重网点与错版文字。这样 RISO 的性格仍在，读者眼睛不会被印刷过程干扰。</p>
              <h4>Small heading</h4>
              <p>标题、引用和图片可以承担更多印刷表现；正文负责稳定、均匀和可读。</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-avatar-card">
            <h3>Avatar &amp; Identity</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-avatars">
              <span aria-hidden="true">V</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">R</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">P</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </div>
            <p>头像使用叠印底版、网点和深绿描边，适合站主、友链和评论区身份。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="riso-ui-card riso-ui-notion-card">
            <h3>Notion Blocks</h3>
            <div class="riso-ui-notion">
              <h1>Heading 1</h1>
              <h2>Heading 2</h2>
              <h3>Heading 3</h3>
              <p>正文使用低噪纸面，标题保留轻微错版。Inline <strong>bold</strong>、<em>italic</em>、<code>code</code> 和 <a href="#riso-ui-title">link</a> 都能落在同一层油墨上。</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Bulleted list</li>
                <li>Second item</li>
              </ul>
              <ol>
                <li>Numbered list</li>
                <li>Second step</li>
              </ol>
              <hr />

              <blockquote class="riso-ui-notion-quote">
                <p>丝网版画的透明油墨重叠后，会生成第三种颜色；界面中的层也可以这样相遇。</p>
              </blockquote>

              <aside class="callout">
                <span class="callout-icon">🌱</span>
                <div class="callout-content"><strong>Callout block</strong> — 半透明绿色底版承担提示层级，不额外使用高饱和屏幕色。</div>
              </aside>

              <details class="notion-toggle" open>
                <summary>Toggle block</summary>
                <div class="riso-ui-toggle-body">展开后的正文保持稳定行高，只在边框和背景上保留叠印感。</div>
              </details>

              <label class="notion-todo">
                <input type="checkbox" disabled checked />
                <span class="notion-todo-checked">Checked todo</span>
              </label>
              <label class="notion-todo">
                <input type="checkbox" disabled />
                <span>Open todo</span>
              </label>

              <div class="code-block" data-lang="JavaScript">
                <pre><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token function">printRiso</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token parameter">paper</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span>
  paper <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">' + halftone'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>
              </div>

              <figure class="riso-ui-notion-figure">
                <div class="riso-ui-frame" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <figcaption>Image block caption</figcaption>
              </figure>

              <a class="notion-bookmark" href="#riso-ui-title">
                <span class="riso-ui-bookmark-cover" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="notion-bookmark-text">
                  <span class="notion-bookmark-icon-row">🔗</span>
                  <span class="notion-bookmark-title">Bookmark block</span>
                  <span class="notion-bookmark-desc">链接卡片保留纸面填充，缩略图使用网点分色层。</span>
                  <span class="notion-bookmark-url">example.com</span>
                </span>
              </a>

              <div class="notion-column-list">
                <div class="notion-column"><p>Column 1</p></div>
                <div class="notion-column"><p>Column 2</p></div>
                <div class="notion-column"><p>Column 3</p></div>
              </div>

              <div class="riso-ui-embed">
                <div class="riso-ui-embed-inner" aria-hidden="true">Video / Embed</div>
                <p class="video-caption">Embed caption</p>
              </div>

              <table class="notion-table has-col-header">
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Status</th><th>Tag</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td>Page A</td><td>Done</td><td>Design</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Page B</td><td>Doing</td><td>Writing</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="onebit-lab-title">
      <h2 id="onebit-lab-title" class="font-ui text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">1-bit Lab</h2>
      <OneBitLab client:load />
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
/* ===== Lab 布局 ===== */
.lab-section {
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
}
.riso-lab {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 38rem) minmax(18rem, 22rem);
  gap: 1.25rem;
  align-items: start;
}
.riso-stage {
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  background: #eff7e6;
}
.riso-stage canvas {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
.riso-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 1.25rem;
  background: var(--color-background-alt);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
}
.riso-field {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.45rem;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}
.riso-buttons,
.riso-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.riso-buttons button,
.riso-actions button {
  padding: 0.42rem 0.7rem;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  background: none;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 0.3rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.riso-buttons button:hover,
.riso-actions button:hover,
.riso-buttons button.active,
.riso-actions button.active {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  border-color: var(--color-text-muted);
}
.riso-actions .primary {
  color: var(--color-background);
  background: var(--color-text-primary);
  border-color: var(--color-text-primary);
}
.riso-actions .primary:hover {
  color: var(--color-background);
  opacity: 0.82;
}
.riso-field input[type="range"] {
  width: 100%;
  accent-color: #24885a;
}
.riso-note {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

/* ===== RISO UI 组件试验 ===== */
.riso-ui-paper {
  padding: 1.25rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: #173227;
  background:
    radial-gradient(rgba(18, 58, 41, 0.075) 1px, transparent 1.1px),
    linear-gradient(145deg, #f2f8e9, #e3f1d7);
  background-size: 7px 7px, auto;
  border: 1px solid #9dbca4;
  border-radius: 0.65rem;
  box-shadow: 5px 4px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.2), -3px 6px 0 rgba(24, 60, 44, 0.08);
}
.riso-ui-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}
.riso-ui-card,
.riso-ui-quote {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  padding: 1.15rem;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48);
  border: 1px solid #27855b;
  border-radius: 0.55rem;
  box-shadow: 4px 3px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.22), -2px 5px 0 rgba(24, 60, 44, 0.1);
}
.riso-ui-card h3 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.28), -2px 2px 0 rgba(24, 60, 44, 0.14);
}
.riso-ui-card p,
.riso-ui-quote p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #2b4b3b;
}
.riso-ui-tags {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.riso-ui-tags span {
  padding: 0.22rem 0.48rem;
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #16472f;
  background: rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.18);
  border: 1px solid rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.45);
  border-radius: 999px;
}
.riso-ui-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.55rem;
  margin-top: auto;
}
.riso-ui-actions button {
  padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 650;
  color: #173227;
  cursor: pointer;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  border: 1px solid #27855b;
  border-radius: 0.4rem;
  box-shadow: 3px 2px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.25);
  transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
}
.riso-ui-actions .riso-ui-primary {
  color: #f2f8e9;
  background: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.9);
}
.riso-ui-actions button:hover {
  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  box-shadow: 5px 4px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.28);
}
.riso-ui-actions button:active {
  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.22);
}
.riso-ui-media {
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.riso-ui-frame {
  min-height: 210px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(rgba(18, 58, 41, 0.16) 1.5px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.5), transparent 58%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 72% 70%, rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.5), transparent 55%);
  background-size: 8px 8px, auto, auto;
  border: 1px solid rgba(23, 60, 44, 0.55);
  border-radius: 0.45rem;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}
.riso-ui-caption {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.riso-ui-caption strong {
  font-size: 0.84rem;
}
.riso-ui-caption span {
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: #42604f;
}
.riso-ui-quote {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  background: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.1);
  border-style: dashed;
}
.riso-ui-quote::before {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0.65rem;
  left: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 2rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.45);
  content: "“";
}
.riso-ui-quote p {
  max-width: 46rem;
  margin-left: 1.5rem;
}

.riso-ui-nav-card,
.riso-ui-list-card {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}
.riso-ui-nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.45rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.riso-ui-nav a {
  padding: 0.45rem 0.72rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 650;
  color: #244b39;
  text-decoration: none;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);
  border: 1px solid rgba(39, 133, 91, 0.45);
  border-radius: 0.38rem;
  transition: all 0.15s ease;
}
.riso-ui-nav a:hover,
.riso-ui-nav a[aria-current='page'] {
  color: #f2f8e9;
  background: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.82);
  border-color: #27855b;
  box-shadow: 3px 2px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.24);
}
.riso-ui-form-card {
  gap: 0.75rem;
}
.riso-ui-field {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.35rem;
}
.riso-ui-field span,
.riso-ui-checks label,
.riso-ui-hint {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 650;
  color: #42604f;
}
.riso-ui-field input,
.riso-ui-form-card select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 0.55rem 0.68rem;
  color: #1d3b2d;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  background: rgba(248, 255, 242, 0.72);
  border: 1px solid rgba(39, 133, 91, 0.5);
  border-radius: 0.38rem;
  box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.1);
  outline: none;
}
.riso-ui-field input::placeholder {
  color: rgba(66, 96, 79, 0.68);
}
.riso-ui-field input:focus,
.riso-ui-form-card select:focus {
  border-color: #27855b;
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.22);
}
.riso-ui-checks {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.riso-ui-checks label,
.riso-ui-list-card li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.riso-ui-checks input {
  width: 0.95rem;
  height: 0.95rem;
  accent-color: #17855b;
}
.riso-ui-post-card p {
  flex-grow: 1;
}
.riso-ui-meta {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding-top: 0.45rem;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: #4c6a59;
  border-top: 1px dashed rgba(39, 133, 91, 0.28);
}
.riso-ui-frame-blue {
  background:
    radial-gradient(rgba(18, 58, 41, 0.15) 1.5px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 25% 75%, rgba(52, 126, 177, 0.45), transparent 58%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 76% 24%, rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.45), transparent 54%);
  background-size: 8px 8px, auto, auto;
}
.riso-ui-states,
.riso-ui-avatars,
.riso-ui-pagination {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.riso-ui-success,
.riso-ui-warning,
.riso-ui-danger {
  padding: 0.22rem 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.67rem;
  font-weight: 750;
  border: 1px solid;
  border-radius: 999px;
}
.riso-ui-success {
  color: #17472f;
  background: rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.18);
  border-color: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.45);
}
.riso-ui-warning {
  color: #5e4a10;
  background: rgba(228, 189, 83, 0.2);
  border-color: rgba(177, 135, 24, 0.46);
}
.riso-ui-danger {
  color: #662726;
  background: rgba(203, 91, 82, 0.16);
  border-color: rgba(166, 56, 48, 0.44);
}
.riso-ui-progress {
  width: 100%;
  height: 0.65rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(39, 133, 91, 0.3);
  border-radius: 999px;
}
.riso-ui-progress-value {
  display: block;
  width: 68%;
  height: 100%;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23, 133, 91, 0.88) 0 7px, rgba(63, 154, 103, 0.76) 7px 14px);
}
.riso-ui-hint {
  margin: 0;
}
.riso-ui-pagination {
  margin-top: auto;
}
.riso-ui-pagination button {
  min-width: 2.15rem;
  padding: 0.4rem 0.58rem;
  font-size: 0.76rem;
  font-weight: 700;
